Package: nocs
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: Jorge Valencia <jorjazo@gmail.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: indi-bin (>= 2.0), systemd, init-system-helpers
Recommends: indi-3rdparty-drivers, phd2, xvfb
Section: science
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/jorjazo/nocs
Description: web-first control of astrophotography rigs over INDI
 NOCS runs at the telescope and is operated from a phone, tablet or desktop
 browser: equipment profiles, capture, plate solving, guiding with PHD2,
 autofocus and sequences, on top of INDI drivers.
 .
 This package holds nocsd with its own Python runtime, the web app and the
 systemd units that run nocsd, indiserver and PHD2 as the user nocs.
